    tldr: "CLL12 asked whether starting the pill ibrutinib early, before chronic lymphocytic leukaemia causes symptoms, is better than the usual practice of watching and waiting; early treatment delayed the disease but after nearly six years of follow-up people lived just as long either way, so watch and wait remains the standard.",
